{"scenario": "system/hooks-every-profile", "requires": ["v1", "test-hooks"], "doc": "[C] The same three before-tool rules (a deny on reads, a deny on `rm`, a note on edits) over every profile the hooks serve, each as a session: Claude, Claude through the gateway (the OpenRouter-like profile), Codex (the stock adapter, its read-only mode lock and the managed hook), and Gemini, Kimi and DeepSeek, each stock and as the org fork that advertises `before-tool` (the mock mirrors the fork's `_drgnx/panel`: its own `_drgnx/before_tool` goes first, and a deny vetoes the step). Per profile the snapshot says what is hooked and what is not (nothing unhooked: the lock refuses a session that would run a subscribed kind unhooked, and a fork's feature adds nothing to the snapshot), a read is refused, and an allowed edit shows its hook under the step once: a fork's step both sites hooked has the seam's row only, a step only the adapter hooked keeps its own."}
{"do": "root"}
{"do": "sqlite", "path": "$DATA/work.db", "sql_file": "$SCENARIOS/../fixtures/work-db-6.sql"}
{"do": "run", "bin": "/bin/sh", "args": ["-c", "mkdir -p $ROOT/work"], "expect_code": 0}
{"do": "write_file", "path": "$CONFIG/settings.el", "mode": "600", "text": "(drgnx-settings :version 1 (drgnx-agents-profiles ((\"mock-claude\" :provider claude :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"claude\" \"--log\" \"$ROOT/claude.log\")) (\"mock-gw\" :ai claude-openrouter :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"claude\" \"--log\" \"$ROOT/gw.log\")) (\"mock-codex\" :provider codex :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"codex\" \"--log\" \"$ROOT/codex.log\")) (\"mock-gemini\" :provider gemini :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"gemini\" \"--log\" \"$ROOT/gemini.log\")) (\"mock-gemini-fork\" :provider gemini :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"gemini\" \"--panel\" \"before-tool,context,drop,compact-preview\" \"--panel-policy\" \"engine\" \"--log\" \"$ROOT/gemini-fork.log\")) (\"mock-kimi\" :provider kimi :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"kimi\" \"--log\" \"$ROOT/kimi.log\")) (\"mock-kimi-fork\" :provider kimi :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"kimi\" \"--panel\" \"before-tool,context,compact-preview\" \"--log\" \"$ROOT/kimi-fork.log\")) (\"mock-dsh\" :provider deepseek :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"dsh\" \"--log\" \"$ROOT/dsh.log\")) (\"mock-dsh-fork\" :provider deepseek :command (\"$MOCK\" \"acp\" \"--as\" \"dsh\" \"--panel\" \"before-tool,context,drop\" \"--log\" \"$ROOT/dsh-fork.log\")))) (drgnx-agents-matrix (:cells ((:action code.edit :column (:role chat) :verdict allow) (:action code.read :column (:role chat) :verdict allow)))))\n"}
